	)
	(text "WiFi card absent in flight; MCU_WIFI_REQ defaults LOW. No USB/Bluetooth wires or recovery USB.\nCarrier TX has220n series AC capacitors; reference clock follows direct NVIDIA reference.\nCard-off clock/control injection, exact card thermal/load and no-hotplug behavior require measurement."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 255.27 0)
